'' A dynamic array declared with 'any' has a known rank: a subscript and a redim must
'' write that many dimensions (fbc error 36), over a variable and a field alike; 'a()'
'' has rank 0 and takes any shape. An array of a type with no default constructor cannot
'' be declared without an initialiser (fbc error 183) -- a merely DEFAULTED parameter and
'' a written calling convention do not make a default one, for an array.
'' Matches fbc on lines 32-40.
'' TEST: cli
'' ARGS: --dump-ir tests/diagnostics/src/dynamic-rank-and-array-ctor.bas
'' EXPECT-EXIT: 1
'' GOLDEN: expected/dynamic-rank-and-array-ctor.out
